        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Using XTable to translate from Iceberg to Hudi & Delta Lake with a File System Catalog like S3]]></title>
        <id>https://xtable.apache.org/blog/xtable-iceberg-fs-catalog</id>
        <link href="https://xtable.apache.org/blog/xtable-iceberg-fs-catalog"/>
        <updated>2024-05-15T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
